#indent 4

//: # ty/memo_trait_proof_stable_map
//: `.neplproof` artifact の persistent stable map を、reader / preseed が proof store へ入る前に[安全/あんぜん]に[絞/しぼ]り[込/こ]むための contract module です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - `memo_trait_proof_index.nepl` は decoded artifact index table の fingerprint lookup を扱います。この module は、その次段で canonical fingerprint と canonical payload hash を組にした stable map key へ絞り込み、record ordinal candidate range を返します。
//: - canonical payload hash を lookup key に含めることで、同じ fingerprint に複数の canonical key payload が入った artifact でも、後続 reader が走査する collision group を小さくします。
//: - stable map entry は policy と record payload hash を保持しますが、proof acceptance authority ではありません。policy equality、canonical payload decode、payload hash 再計算、proof kind、producer gate、proof store lookup は後続の責務として残します。
//: - lookup failure、sort order corruption、producer failure を bool や表示文字列へ潰さず、typed enum error として返します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - stable map の primary key は `(canonical_fingerprint.schema_version, canonical_fingerprint.root_hash, canonical_payload_hash)` の昇順です。同じ key の entry は record ordinal の昇順で連続します。
//: - `policy` は entry に保存しますが、sort key でも proof acceptance authority でもありません。caller は returned range 内の entry ごとに policy equality を別途検査します。
//: - `SelfhostCanonicalTypeKeyId`、`SelfhostTypeId`、`SelfhostNamedTypeId`、source text、span、path suffix、display name、diagnostic text、lexeme は stable map key、sort key、tie-break authority に入りません。
//: - `selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_from_record_result` は record key と record body を artifact validator へ再投入し、その後 stable map entry validator を通します。不正 record から stable map entry を作りません。
//: - `selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_build_result` は入力 record vector を借用し、成功時に stable map entry vector owner だけを返します。返す前に sorted order を検査します。
//:
//: [戻/もど]り[値/ち]:
//: - lookup の `Ok(range)` は stable map entry vector 内で同じ canonical fingerprint と canonical payload hash を持つ candidate group の開始 index と件数だけを表します。
//: - `Err(CandidateMissing)` は、stable map は有効だが対象 key の candidate group が存在しないことを表します。
//: - `Err(FingerprintOrderInvalid)`、`Err(PayloadHashOrderInvalid)`、`Err(RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid)`、`Err(EntryMissing)` は artifact map を fail-closed に拒否すべき破損です。
//: - producer の `Err(RecordInvalid(_))`、`Err(EntryBuildRejected(_))`、`Err(ProducedOrderRejected(_))` は、writer / preseed が artifact stable map を fail-closed に拒否すべき理由です。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - Phase 1 は decoded `Vec` 上で stable map entry を構築し、lower-bound binary search で range lookup を行います。
//: - 現実装の producer は insertion sort 相当の bubble-back で entry を並べます。これは small decoded artifact を先に fail-closed に扱うための Phase 1 実装であり、後続の persistent binary writer / stable map codec では同じ contract を保ったまま O(n log n) または O(n) の構築へ置き換えます。
//: - この module は proof store に record を入れず、proof store lookup も呼びません。candidate narrowing と proof acceptance を意図的に分離します。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - producer は record 数 n に対して O(n^2) です。各 record の validation と entry construction は O(1)、push は償却 O(1)、bubble-back の合計が O(n^2) です。
//: - sorted order check は entry 数 m に対して O(m) です。
//: - candidate range lookup は lower-bound binary search と collision group count により O(log m + c) です。c は同じ canonical fingerprint と canonical payload hash を持つ candidate 数です。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: ##: [4] ok
//: ##: [5] ok
//: ##: [6] ok
//: ##: [7] ok
//: ##: [8] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_proof_artifact" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_proof_stable_map" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     let checks0 checks_new
//:     match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_stage0:
//:         Result::Ok summary:
//:             let expected_range SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange 0 1
//:             let expected_collision_range SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange 0 2
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_candidate_range_eq (unwrap_ok summary.accepted_range) expected_range
//:             let checks2 checks_push checks1 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_candidate_range_eq (unwrap_ok summary.accepted_collision_range) expected_collision_range
//:             let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.missing_candidate) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing
//:             let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.fingerprint_unsorted) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid
//:             let checks5 checks_push checks4 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.payload_hash_unsorted) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid
//:             let checks6 checks_push checks5 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.ordinal_unsorted) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid
//:             let checks7 checks_push checks6 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_candidate_range_eq (unwrap_ok summary.built_first_range) expected_range
//:             let checks8 checks_push checks7 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_candidate_range_eq (unwrap_ok summary.built_collision_range) expected_collision_range
//:             let checks9 checks_push checks8 check selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_producer_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.invalid_record) SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind::RecordPayloadHashPlaceholder
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks9
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//:         Result::Err _e:
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 Result::Err "stable neplproof map stage0 setup failed"
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks1
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "alloc/collections/vec" as v
#import "core/field" as field
#import "core/math" as *
#import "core/option" as *
#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "./memo_trait" as *
#import "./memo_trait_canonical_key" as *
#import "./memo_trait_canonical_key_payload" as *
#import "./memo_trait_policy" as *
#import "./memo_trait_proof_artifact" as *
#import "./memo_trait_proof_store" as *

//: SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry: persistent stable map の 1 entry
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - canonical fingerprint と canonical payload hash から、artifact record ordinal の候補へ進むための小さい entry を表します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `canonical_fingerprint` と `canonical_payload_hash` が lookup key です。
//: - `policy` は後続 policy equality のために保持しますが、この entry の hit だけでは proof を受理しません。
//: - `record_ordinal` は decoded artifact record vector 内の ordinal です。
//: - `record_payload_hash` は reader が entry と record body の対応を再確認するための sidecar です。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry:
    canonical_fingerprint %SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint
    canonical_payload_hash %i32
    policy %SelfhostMemoTraitProofStorePolicy
    record_ordinal %i32
    record_payload_hash %i32

//: SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange: stable map 内の candidate group
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `start_index` は stable map entry vector 内の開始位置です。
//: - `candidate_count` は同じ canonical fingerprint と canonical payload hash を持つ連続 entry 数です。
//: - この range は proof acceptance ではありません。caller は各 entry が指す record について policy、proof kind、canonical equality、producer gate を続けて検査します。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange:
    start_index %i32
    candidate_count %i32

//: SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind: stable map lookup の拒否理由
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - entry validation、sort order corruption、candidate missing を 1 つの typed error として caller へ返します。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind:
    KeyInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind
    IndexEntryInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind
    RecordInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind
    EntryMissing
    FingerprintOrderInvalid
    PayloadHashOrderInvalid
    RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid
    CandidateMissing

//: SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind: stable map producer の拒否理由
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - decoded record vector から stable map owner を作る時の失敗を、表示文字列ではなく typed enum として呼び出し側へ返します。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind:
    AllocFailed %StdErrorKind
    PushFailed %StdErrorKind
    RecordEntryMissing
    EntryMissing
    RecordInvalid %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofArtifactErrorKind
    EntryBuildRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    ProducedOrderRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapStage0Summary: stable map contract の代表 smoke
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapStage0Summary:
    accepted_range %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    accepted_collision_range %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    missing_candidate %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    fingerprint_unsorted %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    payload_hash_unsorted %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    ordinal_unsorted %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    built_first_range %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    built_collision_range %Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind
    invalid_record %Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapStage0Summary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapStage0Summary \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_candidate_range_eq: candidate range payload が同じか[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_candidate_range_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange bool \a\b:
    and:
        eq a.start_index b.start_index
        eq a.candidate_count b.candidate_count

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_error_kind_eq: stable map error が同じ分類か[返/かえ]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - payload を持つ variant は payload も比較します。
//: - wildcard arm は使いません。error variant を追加した場合、この equality も明示的に更新します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_error_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid a_kind:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid b_kind:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_artifact_error_kind_eq a_kind b_kind
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid a_kind:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid b_kind:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_artifact_error_kind_eq a_kind b_kind
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid a_kind:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid b_kind:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_artifact_error_kind_eq a_kind b_kind
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    true

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_std_error_kind_code: StdErrorKind を比較用 code へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_std_error_kind_code %fn StdErrorKind i32 \kind:
    match kind:
        StdErrorKind::Failure:
            0
        StdErrorKind::OutOfMemory:
            1
        StdErrorKind::EmptyCollection:
            2
        StdErrorKind::IndexOutOfBounds:
            3
        StdErrorKind::KeyNotFound:
            4
        StdErrorKind::CapacityExceeded:
            5
        StdErrorKind::InvalidOperation:
            6
        StdErrorKind::InvalidUtf8:
            7
        StdErrorKind::ParseError:
            8
        StdErrorKind::IoError:
            9
        StdErrorKind::Other:
            10

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_std_error_kind_eq: StdErrorKind が同じ variant か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_std_error_kind_eq %fn StdErrorKind fn StdErrorKind bool \a\b:
    eq selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_std_error_kind_code a selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_std_error_kind_code b

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_producer_error_kind_eq: producer error が同じ分類か[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_producer_error_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed a_kind:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed b_kind:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_std_error_kind_eq a_kind b_kind
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected _b_kind:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed a_kind:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed b_kind:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_std_error_kind_eq a_kind b_kind
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected _b_kind:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected _b_kind:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected _b_kind:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid a_kind:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid b_kind:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_artifact_error_kind_eq a_kind b_kind
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected _b_kind:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected a_kind:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected b_kind:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_error_kind_eq a_kind b_kind
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected _b_kind:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected a_kind:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordInvalid _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected _b_kind:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected b_kind:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_error_kind_eq a_kind b_kind

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_fingerprint_lt: canonical fingerprint の stable order
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_fingerprint_lt %fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint bool \a\b:
    if:
        lt a.schema_version b.schema_version
        then:
            true
        else:
            if:
                gt a.schema_version b.schema_version
                then:
                    false
                else:
                    lt a.root_hash b.root_hash

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_key_lt: stable map key の stable order
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - 比較 key は canonical fingerprint と canonical payload hash だけです。
//: - policy、record payload hash、source 表現、session-local id は key order に含めません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_key_lt %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry bool \a\b:
    if:
        selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_fingerprint_lt a.canonical_fingerprint b.canonical_fingerprint
        then:
            true
        else:
            if:
                selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_eq a.canonical_fingerprint b.canonical_fingerprint
                then:
                    lt a.canonical_payload_hash b.canonical_payload_hash
                else:
                    false

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_target_lt: entry key と lookup target を[比較/ひかく]する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_target_lt %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint fn i32 bool \entry\target_fingerprint\target_payload_hash:
    if:
        selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_fingerprint_lt entry.canonical_fingerprint target_fingerprint
        then:
            true
        else:
            if:
                selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_eq entry.canonical_fingerprint target_fingerprint
                then:
                    lt entry.canonical_payload_hash target_payload_hash
                else:
                    false

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_key_eq: entry key が target と一致するか[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_key_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint fn i32 bool \entry\target_fingerprint\target_payload_hash:
    and:
        selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_eq entry.canonical_fingerprint target_fingerprint
        eq entry.canonical_payload_hash target_payload_hash

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_pair_result: 隣接 entry の sorted order を[検査/けんさ]する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_pair_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \previous\current:
    if:
        selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_fingerprint_lt current.canonical_fingerprint previous.canonical_fingerprint
        then:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::FingerprintOrderInvalid
        else:
            if:
                selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_eq previous.canonical_fingerprint current.canonical_fingerprint
                then:
                    if:
                        lt current.canonical_payload_hash previous.canonical_payload_hash
                        then:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::PayloadHashOrderInvalid
                        else:
                            if:
                                eq previous.canonical_payload_hash current.canonical_payload_hash
                                then:
                                    if:
                                        ge previous.record_ordinal current.record_ordinal
                                        then:
                                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordOrdinalOrderInvalid
                                        else:
                                            Result::Ok unit
                                else:
                                    Result::Ok unit
                else:
                    Result::Ok unit

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_order_tail_loop: 2 件目以降の order を[検査/けんさ]する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_order_tail_loop %fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn i32 Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \entries\previous\idx:
    let n %i32 v::len entries
    if:
        ge idx n
        then:
            Result::Ok unit
        else:
            match v::get entries idx:
                Option::Some current:
                    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_pair_result previous current:
                        Result::Ok _unit:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_order_tail_loop entries current add idx 1
                        Result::Err kind:
                            Result::Err kind
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_order_result: stable map の sorted order を[検査/けんさ]する
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_order_result %fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \entries:
    let n %i32 v::len entries
    if:
        le n 1
        then:
            Result::Ok unit
        else:
            match v::get entries 0:
                Option::Some first:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_order_tail_loop entries first 1
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_count_loop: 同じ stable map key の[件数/けんすう]を[数/かぞ]える
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_count_loop %fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \entries\target_fingerprint\target_payload_hash\start\idx\count:
    let n %i32 v::len entries
    if:
        ge idx n
        then:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange start count
        else:
            match v::get entries idx:
                Option::Some entry:
                    if:
                        selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_key_eq entry target_fingerprint target_payload_hash
                        then:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_count_loop entries target_fingerprint target_payload_hash start add idx 1 add count 1
                        else:
                            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange start count
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lower_bound_loop: target key 以上になる[最初/さいしょ]の index を[二分探索/にぶんたんさく]する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lower_bound_loop %fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \entries\target_fingerprint\target_payload_hash\low\high:
    if:
        ge low high
        then:
            Result::Ok low
        else:
            let mid %i32 add low div_s sub high low 2
            match v::get entries mid:
                Option::Some entry:
                    if:
                        selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_target_lt entry target_fingerprint target_payload_hash
                        then:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lower_bound_loop entries target_fingerprint target_payload_hash add mid 1 high
                        else:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lower_bound_loop entries target_fingerprint target_payload_hash low mid
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lookup_loop: sorted stable map から target key group を[探/さが]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lookup_loop %fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \entries\target_fingerprint\target_payload_hash:
    let n %i32 v::len entries
    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lower_bound_loop entries target_fingerprint target_payload_hash 0 n:
        Result::Ok start:
            if:
                ge start n
                then:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing
                else:
                    match v::get entries start:
                        Option::Some entry:
                            if:
                                selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_key_eq entry target_fingerprint target_payload_hash
                                then:
                                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_count_loop entries target_fingerprint target_payload_hash start start 0
                                else:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::CandidateMissing
                        Option::None:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::EntryMissing
        Result::Err kind:
            Result::Err kind

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lookup_result: stable map から candidate range を[返/かえ]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - sorted order check を通した後でなければ candidate range を返しません。
//: - `Ok(range)` は proof acceptance ではありません。caller は range 内の entry が指す record ごとに canonical payload decode、payload hash 再計算、policy、proof kind、proof store preseed / lookup を通します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lookup_result %fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \entries\target_fingerprint\target_payload_hash:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_order_result entries:
        Result::Ok _sorted:
            selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_lookup_loop entries target_fingerprint target_payload_hash
        Result::Err kind:
            Result::Err kind

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_result_is_ok: lookup result が accepted range か[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_result_is_ok %fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapCandidateRange SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind bool \result:
    match result:
        Result::Ok _range:
            true
        Result::Err _kind:
            false

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_result: stable map entry field を[検査/けんさ]する
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - canonical key schema、canonical payload hash、policy schema は artifact record key validator へ委譲します。
//: - record ordinal と record payload hash は artifact index entry validator へ委譲します。
//: - 成功した entry も proof acceptance authority ではありません。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint fn i32 fn SelfhostMemoTraitProofStorePolicy fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \canonical_fingerprint\canonical_payload_hash\policy\record_ordinal\record_payload_hash\record_count:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_record_key_result canonical_fingerprint selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_payload_schema_version canonical_payload_hash policy:
        Result::Ok _checked_key:
            match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_index_entry_result canonical_fingerprint record_ordinal record_payload_hash record_count:
                Result::Ok _checked_index:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry canonical_fingerprint canonical_payload_hash policy record_ordinal record_payload_hash
                Result::Err kind:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::IndexEntryInvalid kind
        Result::Err kind:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid kind

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_from_record_result: record から stable map entry を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - record key と record body は必ず artifact validator へ再投入します。
//: - 作った stable map entry も stable map entry validator へ通します。
//: - proof payload は stable map entry へ複製しません。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_from_record_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofRecord fn i32 fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind \record\record_ordinal\record_count:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_record_key_result record.key.canonical_fingerprint record.key.canonical_payload_schema_version record.key.canonical_payload_hash record.key.policy:
        Result::Ok checked_key:
            match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_record_result checked_key record.proof_kind record.proof record.record_payload_hash:
                Result::Ok _checked_record:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_result record.key.canonical_fingerprint record.key.canonical_payload_hash record.key.policy record_ordinal record.record_payload_hash record_count
                Result::Err kind:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::RecordInvalid kind
        Result::Err kind:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapErrorKind::KeyInvalid kind

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_lt: producer sort order
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_lt %fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry bool \a\b:
    if:
        selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_key_lt a b
        then:
            true
        else:
            if:
                and:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_eq a.canonical_fingerprint b.canonical_fingerprint
                    eq a.canonical_payload_hash b.canonical_payload_hash
                then:
                    lt a.record_ordinal b.record_ordinal
                else:
                    false

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_bubble_back_loop: push 済み entry を sorted order へ[戻/もど]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_bubble_back_loop %impure fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry impure fn i32 Result unit SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind \entries\idx:
    if:
        le idx 0
        then:
            Result::Ok unit
        else:
            let previous_idx %i32 sub idx 1
            match v::get entries previous_idx:
                Option::Some previous:
                    match v::get entries idx:
                        Option::Some current:
                            if:
                                selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_lt current previous
                                then:
                                    v::replace entries previous_idx current
                                    v::replace entries idx previous
                                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_bubble_back_loop entries previous_idx
                                else:
                                    Result::Ok unit
                        Option::None:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryMissing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_push_sorted: entry を[追加/ついか]し sorted order へ[整/ととの]える
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_push_sorted %impure fn Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind \entries\entry:
    match v::push entries entry:
        Result::Ok next_entries:
            let next_len %i32 v::len &next_entries
            let pushed_index %i32 sub next_len 1
            match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_bubble_back_loop &next_entries pushed_index:
                Result::Ok _sorted:
                    Result::Ok next_entries
                Result::Err kind:
                    v::free next_entries
                    Result::Err kind
        Result::Err e:
            let error %StdErrorKind field::get e "error"
            v::free v::vec_push_error_vec e
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::PushFailed error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_build_loop: decoded records から stable map を[構築/こうちく]する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_build_loop %impure fn Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry impure fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofRecord impure fn i32 impure fn i32 Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind \entries\records\idx\record_count:
    if:
        ge idx record_count
        then:
            Result::Ok entries
        else:
            match v::get records idx:
                Option::Some record:
                    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_entry_from_record_result record idx record_count:
                        Result::Ok entry:
                            match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_push_sorted entries entry:
                                Result::Ok next_entries:
                                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_build_loop next_entries records add idx 1 record_count
                                Result::Err kind:
                                    Result::Err kind
                        Result::Err kind:
                            v::free entries
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::EntryBuildRejected kind
                Option::None:
                    v::free entries
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::RecordEntryMissing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_finish_build: producer output を sorted validator へ[通/とお]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_finish_build %impure fn Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind \entries:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_order_result &entries:
        Result::Ok _order_valid:
            Result::Ok entries
        Result::Err kind:
            v::free entries
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::ProducedOrderRejected kind

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_build_result: decoded records から stable map を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - `.neplproof` serializer / preseed writer が decoded record vector から stable map owner を作るための public producer API です。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - 入力 record vector は借用し、成功時に stable map entry vector owner だけを返します。
//: - record ごとに 1 つの stable map entry を作り、sorted order を検査した owner だけを返します。
//: - 返す stable map は proof acceptance ではありません。caller は lookup 後に canonical payload decode、payload hash 再計算、policy、proof kind、proof store preseed / lookup、producer gate を続けます。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - Phase 1 実装は insertion sort 相当のため O(n^2) です。後続の persistent binary writer / stable map codec では同じ Result contract を保って構築を高速化します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_build_result %impure fn &Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofRecord Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind \records:
    let entries_result %Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapEntry StdErrorKind v::new
    match entries_result:
        Result::Ok entries0:
            let record_count %i32 v::len records
            match selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_build_loop entries0 records 0 record_count:
                Result::Ok built_entries:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_finish_build built_entries
                Result::Err kind:
                    Result::Err kind
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofStableMapProducerErrorKind::AllocFailed e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_stage0_policy: focused smoke 用 policy を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_stage0_policy %fn i32 SelfhostMemoTraitProofStorePolicy \policy_schema:
    let key_source %SelfhostMemoTraitSourceIdentity selfhost_memo_trait_source_identity_new SelfhostMemoTraitSourceKind::MemoKeyTrait 10 11 12
    let value_source %SelfhostMemoTraitSourceIdentity selfhost_memo_trait_source_identity_new SelfhostMemoTraitSourceKind::MemoValueTrait 20 21 22
    let sources %SelfhostMemoTraitSourceIdentitySet selfhost_memo_trait_source_identity_set_new key_source value_source
    let rules %SelfhostMemoTraitRuleIdentity selfhost_memo_trait_rule_identity_new policy_schema 1 30 31 32
    selfhost_memo_trait_proof_store_policy_new sources rules

//: selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_stage0_proof: focused smoke 用 proof を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_stage0_proof %fn void SelfhostMemoTraitStoredAggregateProof \void:
