fn selfhost_memo_trait_neplproof_stable_map_record_push %impure fn Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofRecord impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofRecord Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitNeplProofRecord StdErrorKind \records\record:
